=== Editor Contrib - Line Operations > Bug 18276:[editor] Indentation broken when selection is empty
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null,"insertSpaces":false}
text: "function baz() {"
moveTo 1 2
cmd editor.action.indentLines
expectLine 1 "\tfunction baz() {"
expectPrimarySel 1 3 1 3
cmd tab
expectLine 1 "\tf\tunction baz() {"

